        "help": "Restart systemd service units owned by installed pkm packages. pkm never auto-restarts daemons during upgrade (PRIME DIRECTIVE \u2014 user controls when their machine takes the downtime); this subcommand is the user-driven companion. --list classifies all installed packages; --all restarts every active service owned by a pkm package; positional unit names restart specific units."
